  #line-at(70.824pt, 169.7pt, "AlN, their strong chemical and temperature endurance and their radiation hardness [1]. In ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 197.3pt, "particular, AlInN alloys are special candidates for power electronics, high-efficient emitters, ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 224.9pt, "optoelectronic devices and solar cells [2-8]. In that sense, radio frequency (RF) magnetron ")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 252.5pt, "sputtering allows the deposition of large-area and single-phase AlInN material using this low-")
  #line-at(70.824pt, 280.13pt, "cost and low-temperature technology exportable to the industry. ")
  #line-at(82.824pt, 307.73pt, "Our group has already experience on the deposition of In-rich Al")
